   "about": "A compilation of published extracts examines gold revaluation, reserves, currency, mining controls, and prices.",
   "summary": "The extracts calculate the 1937 revaluation of bank gold reserves and the resulting government profit and Gold Fund Special Account. They also cover gold coinage, purchase law changes, inflation, the foreign exchange fund, and a 1939 call to collect privately held gold. Tables give Manchukuo central bank purchases and Japanese gold prices.",
