   "about": "Tables compare gold output across Japan, its colonies, Manchuria, individual mines, and other countries.",
   "summary": "This attachment gathers quantity and value figures from numerous published sources, expressly noting that even figures from the same source sometimes disagree. It lists Japanese mines, their locations, owners and output, then gives figures for Taiwan, Korea and Manchuria. Its final tables compare Japanese production with world production.",
