   "about": "Published extracts outline Japan’s Gold Production Law and the Gold Production Increase Council.",
   "summary": "The law synopsis describes licensing, compulsory sale of newly refined gold to the government, supervision of miners and refiners, consumption controls, import duty exemptions and subsidies. A newspaper extract describes the proposed council’s government and mining industry membership.",
